{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5G9MBjXSG3PmDZ4jwf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, echoing through stone corridors.*\n\n*A seam of light splits the darkness — warm, golden, widening.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n```\n╔════════════════════════════╗\n║                            ║\n║                            ║\n║                            ║\n║         W E L C O M E      ║\n║                            ║\n║                            ║\n║                            ║\n║                            ║\n╚════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*Beyond me: a passage you haven't walked before. The air smells of rain and old libraries. A faint hum, like the world remembering something it forgot.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":182,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}